codex
There’s a distinction to preserve: `2` permits caching, but the consumer still controls whether and how it caches the mapping. I also found no Alpha checks of the PTE protection masks or dispatch to the memory-management fault vector. The store path appears to accept the access even when it goes through `memory_rw`, so this is broader than a cache-only error.
